OL,3,GNEWSATown centre fully reopened after
OL,4,Aproject milestone
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town centre in East Sussex has a
OL,7,F"new, modern feel" after the latest
OL,8,Fphase of a construction project has
OL,9,Fbeen completed.
OL,11,FSeveral areas of Eastbourne town centre
OL,12,Fhave been pedestrianised as part of
OL,13,Fplans to create a 0.6 mile (0.96km)
OL,14,Fwalkable route from Eastbourne station
OL,15,Fto the seafront.
OL,17,FTerminus Road between Bankers' Corner
OL,18,Fand Marks & Spencer has been
OL,19,Fpedestrianised, alongside Terminus Road
OL,20,Fbetween Grand Parade and Seaside Road,
OL,21,Fknown as the Victoria Place phase.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
