OL,3,GNEWSATown centre fully reopened after
OL,4,Aproject milestone
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeter Griffiths, East Sussex County
OL,7,FCouncil's lead member for transport and
OL,8,Fenvironment, admits these works have
OL,9,Fcome with "their difficulties" but have
OL,10,Fcreated a "vastly improved town
OL,11,Fcentre".
